{"romaji": "Inzai Aru Aru Monogatari", "english": null}, "format": "ONA", "description": "The story centers on a 10-year-old girl named Shirushi Nishizumi who lives in the city, and the alien she meets after it crash lands in Inzai. The alien needs \"Aruaru Energy\" to be able to power back up its spaceship.", "startDate": {"year": 2022, "month": 1}, "endDate": {"year": 2022, "month": 1}, "season": "WINTER", "seasonYear": 2022, "episodes": 1, "duration": 18, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "MANGA", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Slice of Life"], "tags": [{"name": "Aliens", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Female Protagonist", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Parody", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "School", "rank": 40, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 148960, "title": {"romaji": "Aikatsu! 10th STORY: Mirai e no STARWAY", "english": null}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": "The main leads Ichigo Hoshimiya and Akari Oozora in their debut outfits as the Cosmos duo (from the television series finale). The film's story introduction reveals that the first live Cosmos concert was a great success. Later, Ichigo faces her graduation from Starlight Academy in half a year — but even after graduation, the life of an idol continues.", "startDate": {"year": 2022, "month": 7}, "endDate": {"year": 2022, "month": 7}, "season": "SUMMER", "seasonYear": 2022, "episodes": 1, "duration": 25, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": "#アイカツ #aikatsu", "genres": ["Music"], "tags": [{"name": "Idol", "rank": 84, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Cute Girls Doing Cute Things", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Primarily Female Cast", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Henshin", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Female Protagonist", "rank": 73, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "School", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Primarily Teen Cast", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Augmented Reality", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Dancing", "rank": 40, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Work", "rank": 40, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Kids", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Primarily Adult Cast", "rank": 10, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 148970, "title": {"romaji": "Ginga Eiyuu Densetsu: Die Neue These - Sakubou", "english": "Legend of the Galactic Heroes: Die Neue These - Intrigue"}, "format": "ONA", "description": "After Yang Wen-li successfully captures the Iserlohn Fortress, the Free Planets Alliance grows bolder in its militaristic ambitions. With recent incursions into Galactic Empire territory and the possession of a perfect beachhead, the Alliance is now able to deal significant damage to the Empire. However, Reinhard von Lohengramm has no intention of allowing the Free Planets Alliance to gain a foothold. He is adamant about carrying on his best friend Siegfried Kircheis' dearest wish: to be the one to unite the universe.\n<br><br>\nAs wide-scale military clashes continue, the opportunist Adrian Rubinsky, Fezzan's ambitious leader, attempts to take advantage of the war to further his personal goals.\n<br><br>\n(Source: MAL Rewrite)\n<br><br>\n<i>Note: It received a limited special screening in theaters with the episodes spliced together into 3 separate movies.</i>", "startDate": {"year": 2022, "month": 9}, "endDate": {"year": 2022, "month": 12}, "season": "FALL", "seasonYear": 2022, "episodes": 12, "duration": 25, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "NOVEL", "hashtag": "#ノイエ銀英伝", "genres": ["Action", "Drama", "Sci-Fi"], "tags": [{"name": "Space Opera", "rank": 100, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Politics", "rank": 96, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Military", "rank": 96, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "War", "rank": 93, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Space", "rank": 92, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Ensemble Cast", "rank": 85, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Male Protagonist", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Primarily Adult Cast", "rank": 76, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Primarily Male Cast", "rank": 71, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "CGI", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 149038, "title": {"romaji": "Tokyo Koya", "english": null}, "format": "MUSIC", "description": "Music video for the song <i>Tokyo Koya</i> by Van.", "startDate": {"year": 2022, "month": 5}, "endDate": {"year": 2022, "month": 5}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 4, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Drama"], "tags": []}, {"id": 149071, "title": {"romaji": "Fanren Xiu Xian Zhuan: Zai Bie Tiannan", "english": null}, "format": "ONA", "description": null, "startDate": {"year": 2022, "month": 4}, "endDate": {"year": 2022, "month": 7}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 14, "duration": 19, "countryOfOrigin": "CN", "source": "WEB_NOVEL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Action", "Adventure", "Fantasy"], "tags": [{"name": "Full CGI", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 149073, "title": {"romaji": "Boku no Hero Academia 5 (ONA)", "english": "My Hero Academia Season 5 OVA"}, "format": "ONA", "description": "Original animation episodes for the fifth season of <i>Boku no Hero Academia</i>.\n<br><br>\n<b>Entry includes: </b><br>\n\n1) <i><b>Boku no Hero Academia: HLB (My Hero Academia: HLB)</b></i> <br>\n\nHLB stands for “Hero League of Baseball” - it is a baseball league founded by pro-heroes who love baseball!<br>\n\n It’s game day! The last game of HLB championship is between Gang Orca and Shishido's two rival agencies. They form a team (“Orcas” and “Lionels”) to compete. In the world of HLB, there is no rule – using their quirks is of course accepted. However, just when the game is about to finish, they are interrupted by a villain. Who will be the winner of HLB!? <br><br>\n\n2) <i><b>Boku no Hero Academia: Warae! Jigoku no You ni (My Hero Academia: Laugh! As if you are in hell)</i></b><br>\n\n\nDeku, Bakugo, and Todoroki participate in internship under the No.1 hero, Endeavor's agency. One of their tasks these days is to find a villain (“Smiley”) who draws doodles in the city. However, since the urgency is so low, they let other pro-heroes solve this case. One day, Smiley draws a doodle on Endeavor’s house! Being furious, Endeavor himself and the 1-A trio go out to get the villain. However, Smiley’s quirk turns out to be something ridiculous but powerful... It is to make anyone who looks into his eyes laugh hysterically! Can the team capture the villain and stop laughing!? <br><br>\n(Source: Crunchyroll) <br><br>\n\n<i>Note: The ONA had a preliminary showing in theaters from June 16 to June 19 as part of  \"Hero Day\" 2022.</i>", "startDate": {"year": 2022, "month": 8}, "endDate": {"year": 2022, "month": 8}, "season": "SUMMER", "seasonYear": 2022, "episodes": 2, "duration": 23, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "MANGA", "hashtag": " #heroaca_a #ヒロアカ", "genres": ["Action", "Comedy", "Sports"], "tags": [{"name": "Super Power", "rank": 100, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Baseball", "rank": 84, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Superhero", "rank": 80, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Shounen", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Ensemble Cast", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "School", "rank": 66, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Crime", "rank": 65, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Guns", "rank": 45, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Slapstick", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 149095, "title": {"romaji": "Jidao Long Shen", "english": null}, "format": "ONA", "description": null, "startDate": {"year": 2022, "month": 7}, "endDate": {"year": 2022, "month": 11}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 40, "duration": null, "countryOfOrigin": "CN", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Action", "Fantasy"], "tags": [{"name": "Full CGI", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 149098, "title": {"romaji": "Mahoutsukai Reimeiki × Machikado Mazoku 2-Choume Collab Mini Anime", "english": null}, "format": "ONA", "description": null, "startDate": {"year": 2022, 